{"1473960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wreck Runners", "steam_appid": 1473960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/3e18b9b1bf48298366a609236efc9d7c.avif?t=1787872428\" width=1200 height=366 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wreck Runners is an up to 4 player online co-op extraction game set in a haunted and ever-changing Bermuda Triangle. Hired by the suspiciously cheerful Trustwell Corporation, your crew of runners is sent in to recover valuable salvage. We expect you may find far more than sunken wrecks waiting in the Fog.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/235949b76ab2802597a4633679cfce82.poster.avif?t=1787872428\" width=746 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/235949b76ab2802597a4633679cfce82.webm?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/235949b76ab2802597a4633679cfce82.mp4?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RECOVER THE IMPOSSIBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the powerful Scrapjack to haul salvage onto your all-terrain vehicle. Everything is physics-driven - every grab, every throw, every desperate attempt to secure loot while the world falls apart around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/fa36c5462af33a6329730980e4fcaaab.poster.avif?t=1787872428\" width=746 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/fa36c5462af33a6329730980e4fcaaab.webm?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/fa36c5462af33a6329730980e4fcaaab.mp4?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE VEHICLE, ONE CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out in the Triangle, the ORCA is more than just transport. Across land, sea, and air, it is the only constant when you’re running. Keep the haul moving, keep each other alive, and get home in one piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/76c7dde210e14bb9a1cf93562e37f230.poster.avif?t=1787872428\" width=746 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/76c7dde210e14bb9a1cf93562e37f230.webm?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/76c7dde210e14bb9a1cf93562e37f230.mp4?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW YOUR OPERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash in your salvage between runs and put your hard-earned money toward better equipment, new upgrades, and fresh cosmetics. The more you brave the Fog, the better your crew gets at surviving it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/d5ddbf8fbc492e8d53409877c1a7df5e.poster.avif?t=1787872428\" width=746 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/d5ddbf8fbc492e8d53409877c1a7df5e.webm?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/d5ddbf8fbc492e8d53409877c1a7df5e.mp4?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO TWO TRIPS ARE THE SAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Triangle never stays still. Every run starts differently, loot turns up in new places, and whatever's lurking in the Fog keeps your crew guessing. Adapt fast, trust your friends, and expect your plans to fall apart.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wreck Runners is an up to 4 player online co-op extraction game set in a haunted and ever-changing Bermuda Triangle. Hired by the suspiciously cheerful Trustwell Corporation, your crew of runners is sent in to recover valuable salvage. We expect you may find far more than sunken wrecks waiting in the Fog.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/235949b76ab2802597a4633679cfce82.poster.avif?t=1787872428\" width=746 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/235949b76ab2802597a4633679cfce82.webm?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/235949b76ab2802597a4633679cfce82.mp4?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RECOVER THE IMPOSSIBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the powerful Scrapjack to haul salvage onto your all-terrain vehicle. Everything is physics-driven - every grab, every throw, every desperate attempt to secure loot while the world falls apart around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/fa36c5462af33a6329730980e4fcaaab.poster.avif?t=1787872428\" width=746 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/fa36c5462af33a6329730980e4fcaaab.webm?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/fa36c5462af33a6329730980e4fcaaab.mp4?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE VEHICLE, ONE CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out in the Triangle, the ORCA is more than just transport. Across land, sea, and air, it is the only constant when you’re running. Keep the haul moving, keep each other alive, and get home in one piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/76c7dde210e14bb9a1cf93562e37f230.poster.avif?t=1787872428\" width=746 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/76c7dde210e14bb9a1cf93562e37f230.webm?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473960/extras/76c7dde210e14bb9a1cf93562e37f230.mp4?t=1787872428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW YOUR OPERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash in your salvage between runs and put your hard-earned money toward better equipment, new upgrades, and fresh cosmetics. The more you brave the Fog, the better your crew gets at surviving it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla